 "remarks": "Welcome to this magnificent oasis, tucked away in the heart of Cranbury. Rich hardwood floors flow throughout, setting an elegant tone from the moment you enter. Just inside, a spacious dining room invites memorable gatherings. Ahead, a stunning, updated eat-in kitchen boasts abundant cabinetry, updated stainless appliances & a cozy fireplace beside the eating area, opening seamlessly to the owner's favorite room, a bright, sun-drenched screened-in porch & sitting area; great to sit with a cup of coffee and a good book. A generous family room adjoins the kitchen, flowing to a mudroom with built-in cubbies off the oversized 2-car garage with attic storage. A private main-level office/den is perfect for working from home, and a partially finished basement adds even more living & entertainment space. Upstairs, 4 comfortable bedrooms await, including a serene primary suite with ensuite bath - all bathrooms have been beautifully updated. Step outside to the true showstopper: a private, landscaped backyard oasis with pergola & bar area - plus an incredible inground pool with brand-new heater & liner (2026). Heat with 4 zones & central air round out this amazing home. Walkable to Cranbury Elementary & minutes to parks, shops & dining; this move-in ready homerun delivers modern updates and total privacy without ever feeling isolated. Elegant, effortless & unforgettable - this is the home you've been waiting for. Don't miss it!",
